# UI and trust framing

- Show **P50 and P80** peak one-way minutes; label costs as heuristic estimates.
- Keep in-UI caveats near results (PRD F23): not live Grab/Google ETAs; rain/peak variance.
- Decision brief (`src/lib/report.ts`) must repeat the same honesty — plain `.txt` download/copy, not HTML.
- Map flow: office pin first, then homes; move-home click threshold 400 m; unlimited homes.
- Prefer existing mapcn/MapLibre + shadcn patterns; avoid dashboard chrome and fake “live traffic” badges.
- `/admin` is localStorage master presets only — never imply accounts or multi-tenant admin.
